### SUBGRUPO 1: GESTIÓN DE PERSONAL
### ==========================================

### --- EMPLEADOS ---
### Listar
GET {{ BASE_URL }}/Empleados/empleadoslistar HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ AUTH_TOKEN }}
Content-Type: application/json

### Crear
POST {{ BASE_URL }}/Empleados/empleadoscrear HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ AUTH_TOKEN }}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "codigo_empleado": "EMP-2026101",
    "nombre": "Cristopher",
    "apellido": "Chaves",
    "dni": "2-0123-0456",
    "fecha_ingreso": "2026-02-06",
    "salario_base": 750000,
    "puesto_id": 2
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{ BASE_URL }}/Servicio1/empleadosactualizar/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ AUTH_TOKEN }}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Mario",
    "apellido": "Chaves Rojas",
    "salario_base": 800000,
    "puesto_id": 2
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{ BASE_URL }}/Servicio1/empleadoseliminar/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ AUTH_TOKEN }}


